{"ref":"BDB, שְׁדֵמָה","hw":"שְׁדֵמָה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁדֵמָה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. field</strong>;—only pl.: abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁדֵמוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:17\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.17\">Hb 3:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:40\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.40\">Je 31:40</a> Qr (> Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">השׁרמות</span>); cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁדְמ(וֹ)ת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:32\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.32\">Dt 32:32</a> + 2 times;—<em>fields</em>, as cultivated <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:32\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.32\">Dt 32:32</a>, also (c. vb. sg.) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.8\">Is 16:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:17\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.17\">Hb 3:17</a>; as locality <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:4\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.4\">2 K 23:4</a>, area <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:40\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.40\">Je 31:40</a>.—<span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁדֵמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:27\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.27\">Is 37:27</a> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, שְׁדֵפָה\" href=\"/BDB,_שְׁדֵפָה\", dir=\"rtl\">שְׁדֵפָה</a>.","next":"BDB, שָׁדַף","prev":"BDB, שׁדם"}